  "function_code": 86,
  "name": "Elapsed Timer",
  "description": "The elapsed timer function code measures elapsed time. This is especially useful for batch control applications, and may be used for maintenance purposes such as operating time measurements. Time units are configurable to seconds, minutes, hours or days with S3. The timer performs either up or down timing functions, and can be held to a particular value or reset to a specified initial value by external logic.",
  "description_lines": [
